      "author": "llxzxzxll",
      "description": "# Particle Spoilers 1.3.0\r\n\r\nWhat's new in version:\r\n\r\n- **New \"Spoiler Style\" Dropdown:** You can now choose between the classic \"Particle\" style and the new \"Block\" style (a solid color rectangle that hides text, similar to Discord or Steam).\r\n\r\n- **Block Style Color Options:** The Block style uses your theme's accent color by default. A new dropdown appears when the Block style is selected, allowing you to switch between \"App accent color\" and a \"Custom color\" with a dedicated color picker. These settings apply only to the Block style.\r\n\r\n- **Block Style Text Color Update:** When a Block spoiler is revealed, the text color now defaults to the standard note text color instead of taking on the accent or custom color. The background retains a slight tint based on your chosen color.\r\n\r\n- **Lightweight Block Implementation:** The new Block style is implemented as a separate, ultra-lightweight class without using canvas or particles. The original SpoilerInstance (Particle) remains completely untouched.",
