      "author": "llxzxzxll",
      "description": "# Particle Spoilers 1.2.0 \r\n\r\n### What's new:\r\n\r\n- Added Icon: A new \"eye-off\" icon is now available on the left sidebar. Simply select text in the editor and click the icon to instantly wrap it in spoiler tags (||...||).\r\n- Command Palette Integration: Added the \"Insert spoiler\" command. You can now easily bind a custom hotkey to quickly format selected text into a spoiler.\r\n- Performance Optimization: Rewritten animation logic with a Shared Animation Scheduler and Color Resolution Cache to significantly reduce CPU usage and improve canvas rendering speeds.",
